# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002418> (causally upstream of or within)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002418> "p is 'causally upstream or within' q iff p is causally related to q, and the end of p precedes, or is coincident with, the end of q.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002418> "We would like to make this disjoint with 'preceded by', but this is prohibited in OWL2")
